Subject: [PATCH] Wiki Research: round 2 on Insight Timer, with its journeys as
 diagrams

The Research tab now has two versions, the newer first: v2 Behaviour &
journeys (docs/research/reports/Insight Timer behaviour and journeys.md:
how people actually use it from Reddit, Trustpilot and reviews; its whole
journey as 11 flow charts; why it keeps and loses people; twenty features
to adopt, a roast, and the recommendations that survive, now/next/later)
and v1 Features & business (round 1). Markdown versions get the Markdown
styling.

Flow charts written as ```mermaid blocks render as diagrams in the wiki.
Mermaid (11.17.1) and everything it pulls in is one lazy chunk, loaded only
by a document that has a chart, and kept out of the service worker's
precache (181 entries, as before). A chart that fails to render stays as
its source text with a red edge.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
